[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3123.67, "timestamp": "00:52:03", "text": "這基本上就是我在提高效率的過程中尋找樂趣。是的，這就是我最近的生活狀況。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3131.67, "timestamp": "00:52:11", "text": "你怎麼了？對我來說，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3136.069, "timestamp": "00:52:16", "text": "呃，就是努力拼搏。  還有這一點。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3146.309, "timestamp": "00:52:26", "text": "太棒了，兄弟。  下個月我就要走了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3149.43, "timestamp": "00:52:29", "text": "所以，我只有一個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3151.75, "timestamp": "00:52:31", "text": "。不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3165.67, "timestamp": "00:52:45", "text": "我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3168.95, "timestamp": "00:52:48", "text": "想只剩下這週和下週了"}]